All good.

1049
00:45:16,980 --> 00:45:17,340
That's fine.

1050
00:45:17,960 --> 00:45:18,599
Oh, bugger that.

1051
00:45:18,840 --> 00:45:19,119
OK.

1052
00:45:20,599 --> 00:45:21,460
