1053
00:45:21,719 --> 00:45:22,039
Yeah.

1054
00:45:22,340 --> 00:45:22,599
Oh, yeah.

1055
00:45:22,760 --> 00:45:22,980
Yeah.

1056
00:45:23,039 --> 00:45:23,880
Oh, you did now.

1057
00:45:24,059 --> 00:45:24,880
Oh, god.

1058
00:45:26,619 --> 00:45:26,940
Bugger it.

1059
