1063
00:45:31,500 --> 00:45:31,760
Yes.

1064
00:45:31,900 --> 00:45:32,920
Oh, predetermined.

1065
00:45:33,920 --> 00:45:34,780
Predetermined into the microphone.

1066
00:45:34,900 --> 00:45:35,840
It was predetermined.

1067
00:45:35,860 --> 00:45:36,500
Yes, it was.

1068
00:45:36,699 --> 00:45:37,019
Yes.

1069
