1204
00:50:55,070 --> 00:50:55,469
Yes.

1205
00:50:55,510 --> 00:50:58,070
So if you do want to come, bring extra pants.

1206
00:50:58,309 --> 00:50:58,710
Yes.

1207
00:50:59,829 --> 00:51:01,610
I'll leave this there for you if you'd like to take it down.

1208
00:51:01,650 --> 00:51:02,269
But here's the thing.

1209
00:51:02,610 --> 00:51:04,610
What's the most impossible thing in this world?

1210
00:51:04,869 --> 00:51:05,809
I must do it.

1211
00:51:06,110 --> 00:51:09,909
Because if I can do the most impossible thing, it therefore makes everything else below it possible.

1212
00:51:10,150 --> 00:51:16,230
And the most impossible thing is in that box.

1213
00:51:22,500 --> 00:51:24,280
You've been keeping an eye on this box, obviously.

1214
00:51:25,599 --> 00:51:26,679
You didn't hear anything?

1215
