No?

1216
00:51:28,219 --> 00:51:28,420
Good.

1217
00:51:28,820 --> 00:51:30,059
It's already dead, so it's fine.

1218
00:51:30,239 --> 00:51:34,360
There was a lady who joined me on stage who played the coin game with me.

1219
00:51:34,619 --> 00:51:36,519
Is she still here, or has she run off already?

1220
00:51:37,239 --> 00:51:37,659
Oh, good.

1221
00:51:37,719 --> 00:51:40,320
Could you mind joining me back on stage, please, as one last time?

1222
00:51:40,400 --> 00:51:42,599
