1223
00:51:43,000 --> 00:51:43,460
Thank you.

1224
00:51:43,559 --> 00:51:44,480
Come join me on stage.

1225
00:51:45,460 --> 00:51:46,320
Thank you very much.

1226
00:51:46,460 --> 00:51:47,820
