1227
00:51:48,300 --> 00:51:52,659
You see, inside the box that the gentleman so lovely took care of it for me, I have a jar.

1228
00:51:52,840 --> 00:51:54,260
And inside the jar, I keep a script.

1229
00:51:54,280 --> 00:51:55,059
So thank you for this.

1230
00:51:55,400 --> 00:51:58,920
And inside this scroll is something for you.

