00:52:00,280 --> 00:52:02,940
I just wrote a few things about how the show was going to go.

1232
00:52:03,079 --> 00:52:04,480
So if you could just stand here, please, if you don't mind.

1233
00:52:05,440 --> 00:52:05,980
Thank you.

